/// the available instance types that meet your requirements. This can
/// provide Amazon EC2 Auto Scaling with a larger selection of instance
/// types to choose from when fulfilling Spot and On-Demand capacities. You
/// can view which instance types are matched before you apply the instance
/// requirements to your Auto Scaling group. After you define your instance
