  /// instance is launched, and the desired capacity is exceeded by three
  /// units. For more information, see Configure an Auto Scaling group to use
  /// instance weights in the Amazon EC2 Auto Scaling User Guide . Value must
  /// be in the range of 1–999. If you specify a value for WeightedCapacity
