  /// Auto Scaling instance passed an ELB health check. Note that the target
  /// group enters this state immediately if you attach it in the
  /// CreateAutoScalingGroup API call. Removing - The Auto Scaling instances
  /// are being deregistered from the target group. If connection draining is
  /// enabled, Elastic Load Balancing waits for in-flight requests to complete
  /// before deregistering the instances. Removed - All Auto Scaling instances
  /// are deregistered from the target group.
  pub state: Str? = None
}

